19500010102", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001691_941319503343435_2136109628830733637_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tWYs-x2gOVgQ7kNvwEwztkk&_nc_oc=AdpSvAKd7KtGhm28E5MRYgExCKA4zdEAJ2wPV5emicFU3udltqEhJxwcoQoWbTOr_ng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRNRu98jiMlw92uPZBjOwhJAmfB7a22fQwuwbZ2dFX8Lg&oe=6B0B31F8"}, "display_name": "SweeperVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Minesweeper has finally come to Virtual Reality! Flag, count, and open cells in this fully 3D reinvention of the classic game.\n\nFeatures:\n- View the entire minefield in cube view, or highlight an individual plane\n- Fully customizable minefield spawning parameters, with difficulty presets\n- Drag, drop, scale, and rotate the minefield to locate mines from any angle\n- Standard Minesweeper game mechanics and timer\n\nProfessional mine-defusers and newbies alike will be able to enjoy the challenges and gameplay of SweeperVR!", "short_description": "Minesweeper has finally come to Virtual Reality! Flag, count, and open cells in this fully 3D, yet familiar, reinvention of the classic game. Professional mine-defusers and newbies alike will be able to enjoy the challenges and gameplay of SweeperVR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://awesomestuff.software/privacy-policy/SweeperVR.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Awesome Stuff Software", "support_website_url": "http://awesomestuff.software/contact", "website_url": "http://www.awesomestuff.software/games/sweepervr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "ARCADE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEM